      "index": 5,
      "fill": "the five kinds of smoke",
      "notes": "To reach twelve from the dark triads: (1) five elements + (2) five spirits in the elements already yields ten; the remaining two in this tradition are the ‘smoke/breath’ (dark exhalations) and the ‘fire’ of concupiscence—yet here ‘fire and lust’ are reserved for later nights. So the natural correspondential complement in the first night is the dark exhalative products of the sense-organs, commonly enumerated as ‘smokes’ in this register.",
